From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 06:26:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132: Describe the memory cache and power
 controllers

Add the T8132 memory cache controller (MCC) and the performance
management controller (PMC) with its CLPC child, as the Aurora
integration branch describes them for T8132. Both nodes stay disabled
here. A board turns them on when it hands the PMP over to Linux.

The register windows are SoC properties. On the J604 (25G83 stub,
macOS 26B123) the ADT places them the same way as on the J713:
- the MCC planes at 0x220000000 and 0x222000000 (mcc reg[7], reg[8]),
  with plane-count-per-amcc = 2 and dcs-count = 4
- the PMC voters at 0x382800000 and the rails at 0x3828aa000, inside
  the PMGR window (pmgr reg[48], 0x382000000 + 16 MiB)
- voter agents 0:PMP 1:CLPC 2:GFX 3:AP

This takes only the new t8132-memory.dtsi and its include from
c6b301adfd. The rest of that commit, the T8132 platform controllers,
is already present here in its own form.

(partial cherry picked from commit c6b301adfd)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-memory.dtsi | 28 +++++++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi        |  1 +
 2 files changed, 29 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-memory.dtsi

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-memory.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-memory.dtsi
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..fea5b3a97d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-memory.dtsi
@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0+ OR MIT
+/* T8132 memory/cache resources, also used by the legacy-loader adapter. */
+
+&soc {
+	mcc: memory-controller@220000000 {
+		compatible = "apple,t8132-mcc";
+		reg = <0x2 0x20000000 0x0 0x1c1c04>,
+		      <0x2 0x22000000 0x0 0x1c1c04>;
+		status = "disabled";
+	};
+
+	pmc: power-management@382800000 {
+		compatible = "apple,t8132-pmc";
+		reg = <0x3 0x82800000 0x0 0x10000>,
+		      <0x3 0x828aa000 0x0 0x3000>;
+		reg-names = "voters", "rails";
+		#address-cells = <1>;
+		#size-cells = <0>;
+		apple,pmp = <&pmp>;
+		status = "disabled";
+
+		clpc: performance-controller@3 {
+			compatible = "apple,t8132-clpc";
+			reg = <3>;
+			apple,gpu-power-state = <&ps_gfx>;
+		};
+	};
+};
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi
index f0b96c8c55..2ae3200ebe 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132.dtsi
@@ -1232,3 +1232,4 @@
 };
 
 #include "t8132-pmgr.dtsi"
+#include "t8132-memory.dtsi"
